    <article>
      <h2>Lion</h2>
      <p>
        The lion is a large carnivorous mammal.
        It usually lives in groups called prides
        and is often referred to as the king of the jungle.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Elephant</h2>
      <p>
        Elephants are the largest land animals.
        They are highly intelligent, have strong social bonds,
        and excellent memory.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article>
      <h2>Dolphin</h2>
      <p>
        Dolphins are intelligent marine mammals.
        They are known for their communication skills
        and playful behavior.
      </p>
    </article>

  </main>

